<title>USA: Red Roof declines comment on stock move-NYSE.</title>
<headline>Red Roof declines comment on stock move-NYSE.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Stock Exchange Wednesday said Red Roof Inns Inc declined to comment on its stock activity, citing corporate policy.</p>
<p>The NYSE said it had requested that the company issue a public statement on whether there were any corporate developments which may explain the unusual market activity in its stock.</p>
<p>The stock rose 3/4 to 17-3/4 after touching a fresh 52-week high of 18-3/4.</p>
